File Name: index.html

1. Modification Done:

   * Added Razorpay checkout JavaScript script tag so the payment popup can open on Flutter web during membership step 4.

2. Purpose of This Modification:

   * Razorpay requires their checkout.js library in the web page before the payment modal can be shown.

3. How This Modification Is Involved in the Flow:

   * Loaded when the Flutter web app starts.
   * Used by `razorpay_checkout_web.dart` when member pays on `/membership` wizard.
